Apple platform frameworks
-------------------------

Folio calls into Apple's AVFoundation, AudioToolbox, ScreenCaptureKit,
EventKit, AppKit, Cocoa, and CoreFoundation frameworks via FFI. Those
frameworks are part of macOS and are not redistributed; their license is
the Apple SDK License Agreement.

Reporting an attribution miss
-----------------------------

If you ship Folio source or binaries and notice an attribution gap, file
an issue at https://github.com/woosal1337/folio/issues with the
dependency name and license text. We update this file alongside the
dependency change.
